### 1) Seed products (DB-only; nothing indexed yet)
POST http://localhost:8095/api/demo/seed?count=5000

### 2) Start a migration job (async backfill indexing)
POST http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs/products/start?batchSize=500&rateLimit=600&reindexExisting=false&createdBy=demo
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3) List jobs (grab the `id`)
GET http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs

### 4) Poll progress (replace {jobId})
GET http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs/{jobId}/progress

### 5) Semantic search after the job is complete
GET http://localhost:8095/api/products/search?q=wireless%20router&limit=10&threshold=0.3

### 6) Pause / resume / cancel examples
POST http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs/{jobId}/pause

POST http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs/{jobId}/resume

POST http://localhost:8095/api/migration/jobs/{jobId}/cancel
